WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.967
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:02.969
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:03.970
How's everyone doing tonight?

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:04.970
That is so wonderful to hear.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.205
Let's get to the news.

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:08.241
President Biden
spoke yesterday

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:10.409
to French President
Emmanuel Macron

00:00:10.409 --> 00:00:13.479
and acknowledged that the U.S.
should've consulted with France

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:16.683
before announcing a new security
pact with the UK and Australia.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:19.151
But let's be honest,
France has done

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:22.021
some crazy stuff
without consulting us.

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:25.391
She's 150 feet tall, France.

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:28.761
[ Laughter ]
You don't just get someone that
without asking.

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:31.464
Space is hard to come by
in New York.

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:33.065
President Biden hosted
three different groups

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:35.367
of Democratic lawmakers
at the White House yesterday

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:37.103
to discuss his domestic agenda.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:40.206
The Democrats were split
into progressives, moderates,

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.641
and Republicans.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:44.744
A former FDA commissioner said,
in an interview yesterday,

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:48.114
that the upcoming flu season
will be a "whopper."

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.649
Apparently,
it's going to be so bad,

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:52.484
as much as 60% of the country

00:00:52.484 --> 00:00:53.753
will think it's real.

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:55.988
[ Laughter ]
President Biden had lunch today

00:00:55.988 --> 00:00:57.656
with Vice President
Kamala Harris.

00:00:57.656 --> 00:01:00.860
Unfortunately, the menu was one
of those QR codes

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.695
and it took him 45 minutes
to order.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.096
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:06.499
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
yesterday named his pick

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.301
for the state's new
surgeon general

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:10.302
and I guess the good news is

00:01:10.302 --> 00:01:12.405
he's technically a doctor.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.573
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:15.541
A group of House Republicans
on Tuesday

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:18.277
filed articles of impeachment
against President Biden

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:20.679
and, in the interest
of bipartisan unity,

00:01:20.679 --> 00:01:22.682
he's agreed to step down.

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:24.917
[ As Biden ]
We got to work together, folks.

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:27.754
Authorities in Italy recently
arrested a Catholic priest

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.255
for allegedly stealing more

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.391
than $100,000 in funds
from his parish

00:01:32.391 --> 00:01:34.527
to pay for drugs,
and it gets worse --

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:37.297
the drugs were
Flintstones chewables.

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:38.831
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:39.965
I'm just kidding.
It was crack.

00:01:39.965 --> 00:01:41.034
Allegedly.

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:42.902
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.370
Two fire departments
in Illinois

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.671
rescued a dog this week

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:47.640
after it fell
down a 40-foot well.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.408
"Right, fell,"

00:01:49.408 --> 00:01:50.610
said the cat.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.744
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:53.479
Singer Billie Eilish
announced yesterday

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:55.381
that she partnered with Nike
to create shoes

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.484
that are 100% vegan
and get this --

00:01:57.484 --> 00:02:00.587
they actually taste
like real meat.

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:02.154
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.154 --> 00:02:03.822
An online store started selling

00:02:03.822 --> 00:02:06.458
a sexy Halloween costume
version of

00:02:06.458 --> 00:02:09.261
Vermont Senator Bernie Sanders'
inauguration outfit.

00:02:09.261 --> 00:02:11.063
Not as popular -- the sexy

00:02:11.063 --> 00:02:13.299
George W. Bush stuck
in a poncho costume.

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:14.633
[ Laughter ]
And, finally,

00:02:14.633 --> 00:02:17.570
New York's Katz's Deli
and Hendrick's Gin

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.038
have announced they will partner

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:21.574
to make a gin-inspired pickle.

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:23.209
Also pickled by gin?

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.111
The queen, on weekends.

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:29.415
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:30.516
I was nice.

00:02:30.516 --> 00:02:32.085
I think it's probably
all seven days.

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:33.152
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:35.287
I pulled back, out of respect.

00:02:35.287 --> 00:02:36.923
[ Laughter ]
That was a monologue.

